## .gitignore Mandatory Entries
```gitignore
# Secrets — NEVER commit
.env
.env.local
.env.production

# Build output — not needed in repo
dist/
.astro/
node_modules/

# AI memory — not needed in repo
# aimd/ ← Keep in repo for AI context across sessions
```

> **Keep `aimd/` in repo** so AI has memory across different machines/sessions.
> Keep `.env.example` in repo — it shows required keys without real values.
